{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802640/extras/Boom_Gear_Overview_Banner.png?t=1750066900\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Boom Gear</strong> is a wild, high-energy demolition derby where crashing and smashing your way to victory is the only rule that matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slip behind the wheel of a rugged car and barrel into opponents in open-ended free play. Dodge obstacles, out manoeuvre rivals, and leave a trail of mayhem in your wake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every hit counts\u2014rack up your score with epic takedowns and showcase your mastery of pure, arcade-style carnage. It\u2019s you against the metal jungle\u2014no mercy, just high-octane fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802640/extras/Boom_Gear_Customize_Banner.png?t=1750066900\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your car, your style, your rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Boom Gear</strong>, customization is your ticket to personalizing the destruction. Swap out car bodies for different looks\u2014from brawny bruisers to nimble compacts\u2014and bolt on wheels that suit your demolition style. Throw on a flashy paint job that screams attitude: neon grids, bold camo, or even colour splotches if that\u2019s your vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The combination is up to you\u2014build your signature ride, and bring the pain in style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802640/extras/Boom_Gear_Collect_Banner.png?t=1750066900\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demolition isn\u2019t just about smashing\u2014it\u2019s about building your ultimate ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every time you score big, you\u2019ll earn cash to unlock new car bodies and wheels through a random draw system. No rarities, no tiers\u2014just pure, unpredictable fun as you expand your garage with every victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mix and match your collection to create wild combos, and keep experimenting until you find the ultimate setup that suits your unique playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Boom Gear</strong>, every new part is a new way to crush the competition.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3802640?t=1750066900","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802640/785f44069c764cc15e8d6cef3310d6ae1b9b4db4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750066900","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802640/0d7d7bfb17c66de9c28da0ac1b9e2392ab411dfa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750066900","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802640/0d7d7bfb17c66de9c28da0ac1b9e2392ab411dfa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750066900","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802640/extras/Boom_Gear_Overview_Banner.png?t=1750066900\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Boom Gear</strong> is a wild, high-energy demolition derby where crashing and smashing your way to victory is the only rule that matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slip behind the wheel of a rugged car and barrel into opponents in open-ended free play. Dodge obstacles, out manoeuvre rivals, and leave a trail of mayhem in your wake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every hit counts\u2014rack up your score with epic takedowns and showcase your mastery of pure, arcade-style carnage. It\u2019s you against the metal jungle\u2014no mercy, just high-octane fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802640/extras/Boom_Gear_Customize_Banner.png?t=1750066900\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your car, your style, your rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Boom Gear</strong>, customization is your ticket to personalizing the destruction. Swap out car bodies for different looks\u2014from brawny bruisers to nimble compacts\u2014and bolt on wheels that suit your demolition style. Throw on a flashy paint job that screams attitude: neon grids, bold camo, or even colour splotches if that\u2019s your vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The combination is up to you\u2014build your signature ride, and bring the pain in style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802640/extras/Boom_Gear_Collect_Banner.png?t=1750066900\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demolition isn\u2019t just about smashing\u2014it\u2019s about building your ultimate ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every time you score big, you\u2019ll earn cash to unlock new car bodies and wheels through a random draw system. No rarities, no tiers\u2014just pure, unpredictable fun as you expand your garage with every victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mix and match your collection to create wild combos, and keep experimenting until you find the ultimate setup that suits your unique playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Boom Gear</strong>, every new part is a new way to crush the competition.</p>","developers":["Asyynk Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802640/bfc5689f70a6dcd82bbdf52a83841a7497398013/header.jpg?t=1750066900","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257152452,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152452/movie480.mp4?t=1749574247","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152452/movie_max.mp4?t=1749574247"},"name":"Boom_Gear_Release_Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257152452/2979a89f305f04c4b3e0a822a29e022536e79adc/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749574247","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152452/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749574247","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152452/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749574247"}}],"name":"Boom Gear","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-9750H<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1080<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1200 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-12700F<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 3060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Asyynk Studios"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned"